  "content": "<h1>暮色森林 - 地牢与村庄</h1><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c50f1461c986b912e57904acff886b104a1336a_0.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><h2>描述</h2><p>为暮色森林模组添加新内容。</p><ul>\n<li>村庄现在会在暮色森林中生成。</li>\n<li>新增5种职业，附带新的交易方块和物品。</li>\n<li>新的矿工商贩生物会偶尔在你附近生成。</li>\n<li>地牢会在地下生成。</li>\n</ul><h3>新的装饰方块</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ae3614fea51618bf60d42c2168d8b193cbf432c2.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h3>新的商贩生物</h3><p>众多新交易</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/36836bf3c95c028d9ccb51b86eeb2a899820f498_0.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><h2>依赖项</h2><ul>\n<li>你需要安装相同版本的暮色森林模组。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest</a></li>\n</ul><h3>地牢</h3><p>地牢提前到来，首个版本已在1.21.1中实装</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/aa039f6a46f4cd61de44b7928bcc17d3ce250a01_0.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>",
